"無知","kind":"person","person_id":"1hf_1k0_bnj_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m027-0276","start":276,"end":278,"surface":"無知","kind":"person","person_id":"1hf_1k0_bnj_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m027-0298","start":298,"end":300,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"qj2_k5a_sq4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m027-0306","start":306,"end":308,"surface":"無知","kind":"person","person_id":"1hf_1k0_bnj_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p028","text":"桓公元年春，齊君無知游於雍林。雍林人嘗有怨無知，及其往游，雍林人襲殺無知，告齊大夫曰：「無知弒襄公自立，臣謹行誅。唯大夫更立公子之當立者，唯命是聽。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m028-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m028-0006","start":6,"end":10,"surface":"齊君無知","kind":"person","person_id":"1hf_1k0_bnj_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m028-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"雍林人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代，不補未見姓名與成員；官禮等級不直接當授官。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m028-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"無知","kind":"person","person_id":"1hf_1k0_bnj_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m028-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"雍林人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代，不補未見姓名與成員；官禮等級不直接當授官。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m028-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"無知","kind":"person","person_id":"1hf_1k0_bnj_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m028-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"無知","kind":"person","person_id":"1hf_1k0_bnj_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m028-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"qj2_k5a_sq4","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p029","text":"初，襄公之醉殺魯桓公，通其夫人，殺誅數不當，淫於婦人，數欺大臣，群弟恐禍及，故次弟糾奔魯。其母魯女也。管仲、召忽傅之。次弟小白奔莒，鮑叔傅之。小白母，衛女也，有寵於釐公。小白自少好善大夫高傒。及雍林人殺無知，議立君，高、國先陰召小白於莒。魯聞無知死，亦發兵送公子糾，而使管仲別將兵遮莒道，射中小白帶鉤。小白詳死，管仲使人馳報魯。魯送糾者行益遲，六日至齊，則小白已入，高傒立之，是為桓公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"qj2_k5a_sq4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"魯桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"其夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"z16_hit_u7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"群弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代，不補未見姓名與成員；官禮等級不直接當授官。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"糾","kind":"person","person_id":"fng_mjp_tdn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"魯女","kind":"person","person_id":"i7a_rc8_hf1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"h1v_8ap_b9y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"召忽","kind":"person","person_id":"8vp_hqi_6mq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"小白","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"鮑叔","kind":"person","person_id":"hkc_5tg_d73","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029